		// (2)/(3) Delayed Slayer-skill XP (classifySlayerXp() -- combat-
		// branch current, but SUSPENDED not ACTIVE, so this never enters
		// preBatchCurrentMetricUpdates) plus the FIRST weak, non-combat-
